{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神圣御空"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得护盾以及逐渐损失的额外生命上限，并且会在自身生命恢复至上限后进入“神临”状态。主动释放时对前方3格扇形范围造成真实伤害并恢复自身生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时巴赫朗获得80% + 5%初始生命值的护盾以及300% HP额外生命上限且当前生命值不变，这部分额外生命上限每秒损失2%。战斗中巴赫朗生命恢复至上限后展开双翼，对周围2格敌人造成10% HP伤害并进入“神临”状态：不再损失本技能获得的额外生命上限，并且普通攻击会对面前1格扇形区域内的所有敌军造成伤害。逐渐获得额外生命上限以及进入“神临”状态的动作期间处于霸体状态。\n主动释放时，向圣剑注入神力，对前方3格扇形范围内所有敌人造成280% + 40% ATK真实伤害，随后自身恢复实际伤害量40%的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":223,"end":229,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":94,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":183,"end":185,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":219,"end":233,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至300% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至320% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","圣域共鸣"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，巴赫朗在战斗中持续恢复生命值。“神临”状态下攻击会对敌人造成额外真实伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，巴赫朗每秒恢复2% HP生命值；进入“神临”状态后，圣剑永久附着“圣光”，在每次命中敌人时额外附带1.5% + 0.25% HP真实伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":53,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“圣光”额外附带伤害提高至1.8% + 0.25% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“圣光”额外附带伤害提高至2.1% + 0.25% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“圣光”额外附带伤害提高至2.5% + 0.25% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","神怒斩击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","挑飞敌人并击倒面前矩形范围内的所有敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用圣剑挑飞面前目标造成180% + 20% ATK伤害，随后向下劈砍，对前方3格矩形范围内的敌人造成300% + 40% ATK伤害并使其倒地2秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","劈砍伤害提高至320% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","劈砍伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","劈砍伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，每次进入“神临”状态后进一步提高。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升9点，每次进入“神临”状态后额外提升3点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点，每次进入“神临”状态后额外提升4点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升15点，每次进入“神临”状态后额外提升5点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","天启圣辉"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次进入“神临”状态后，恢复“神圣御空”技能中损失的额外生命上限，并且在生命恢复至上限后进入更强大的“神临”状态，永久霸体并且终极技能会额外召唤圣光造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","首次进入“神临”状态后，恢复“神圣御空”技能中损失的额外生命上限，并且当巴赫朗生命再次恢复至上限后进入更强大的“神临”状态，对周围2格敌人造成10% HP真实伤害并永久处于霸体状态，主动释放“神圣御空”后，会在技能范围内每个地图格召唤“圣光”，造成6% HP真实伤害，每次释放时“圣光”命中相同目标的后续伤害降低10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":86,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":124,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","召唤“圣光”造成的伤害提高至8% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","召唤“圣光”造成的伤害提高至10% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次进入“神临”状态时，移除自身所有可驱散的负面状态并且永久提高10%攻击力，第二次进入“神临”状态时还会在自身周围2格范围内召唤“圣光”造成10% HP真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","圣光附带的伤害会削减非首领敌人一定比例的生命上限，会使首领敌人额外失去生命。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“圣光”对非首领敌人造成伤害时会削减目标相当于伤害量70%的生命上限，累计削减部分不超过目标40%最大生命值以及巴赫朗800%攻击力；对首领敌人造成伤害则使其流失0.7% HP的生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":81,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","圣辉"]]}